      "text": "Hmhmhmh♪ Hmhmh~♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 7.2,
      "end_time": 13.2,
      "text": "Hmhmhmhmh♪ Hmhmh, hmhmh~♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 14.4,
      "end_time": 18.6,
      "text": "Hmhmhmh♪ Hmhmh~♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 20.6,
      "end_time": 22.0,
      "text": "Phew..."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 29.0,
      "end_time": 29.8,
      "text": "Hahh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 30.0,
      "end_time": 31.0,
      "text": "EEEK!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 31.4,
      "end_time": 32.8,
      "text": "Kyahaha♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 33.0,
      "end_time": 35.2,
      "text": "Sorry to keep you waiting, Ranpha! ♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 37.4,
      "end_time": 42.2,
      "text": "Oh, Misora... It'd be a pain if someone else were here, you know?"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 42.4,
      "end_time": 43.4,
      "text": "It's all right"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 43.6,
      "end_time": 45.2,
      "text": "I've already cleared out a lot of people"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 46.4,
      "end_time": 47.2,
      "text": "And..."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 48.0,
      "end_time": 49.0,
      "text": "Kariza-kun!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 49.2,
      "end_time": 51.4,
      "text": "If you're nervous, it'll be a beehive♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 51.8,
      "end_time": 52.4,
      "text": "Shut up!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 52.6,
      "end_time": 55.0,
      "text": "No one's interested in your stupidity!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 55.4,
      "end_time": 57.4,
      "text": "And you're the one who tied me to a pillar!"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 57.6,
      "end_time": 59.2,
      "text": "Remember that!"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 60.0,
      "end_time": 63.0,
      "text": "Hmm, should I ask him to be quieter?"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 63.2,
      "end_time": 64.4,
      "text": "Maybe I'll use a gag."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 64.6,
      "end_time": 70.4,
      "text": "Don't worry... I've gotten used to Kariza-kun..."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 73.4,
      "end_time": 77.8,
      "text": "Phew... This is my first time here, but it's a nice place"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start_time": 78.0,
      "end_time": 80.2,
      "text": "Thanks, Misora"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start_time": 80.6,
      "end_time": 81.8,
      "text": "It's okay♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start_time": 82.4,
      "end_time": 84.0,
      "text": "Aren't we friends?★"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start_time": 84.2,
      "end_time": 85.8,
      "text": "Ahh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start_time": 86.4,
      "end_time": 88.0,
      "text": "Friends..."
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start_time": 88.2,
      "end_time": 89.4,
      "text": "Yeah..."
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start_time": 92.4,
      "end_time": 93.4,
      "text": "Hehehe..."
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start_time": 93.6,
      "end_time": 95.2,
      "text": "Oh, that's right♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start_time": 95.4,
      "end_time": 97.8,
      "text": "I've got a great idea!"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start_time": 98.2,
      "end_time": 100.0,
      "text": "Huh? What could it be...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start_time": 100.2,
      "end_time": 101.6,
      "text": "Heheheheh..."
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start_time": 102.6,
      "end_time": 104.6,
      "text": "If Ranpha-san was with Kishi-san"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start_time": 104.8,
      "end_time": 107.2,
      "text": "It's a way to get to know each other better. ★"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start_time": 107.4,
      "end_time": 108.4,
      "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start_time": 108.6,
      "end_time": 110.2,
      "text": "Whaaaaat?!"
    }
  ],
